'''''Carex extensa''''' is a species of [[Carex|sedge]] known by the common name '''long-bracted sedge'''.<ref>[http://www.ukwildflowers.com/Web_pages/carex_extensa_long_bracted_sedge.htm Long-bracted sedge] British wildflowers</ref><ref name=BSBI07>{{BSBI 2007 |accessdate=2014-10-17 }}</ref> It is native to Europe, North Africa, and the Middle East.<ref>[http://apps.kew.org/wcsp/namedetail.do?name_id=226423 Kew World Checklist of Selected Plant Families]</ref>

